# SHA-256 of the Serotine release key's certificate, as apksigner prints it.
# sign-release (android-apk.yml) refuses any signer but this one, and a user
# compares a downloaded Serotine-<tag>-android.apk against it with
#   apksigner verify --print-certs Serotine-<tag>-android.apk
# (docs/android-release-signing.md). Changing it means rotating the key.
